AGENTS.md

# E2E: scratch data the browser suite writes, plus its reports.
# `e2e/.tmp/` is the ONLY place the suite is allowed to write; it stands in for
# the real output/ and data/ so a test run can never touch them.
e2e/.tmp/
e2e/playwright-report/
e2e/test-results/
